@startuml
autonumber
actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database MongoDB
participant "Gemini API" as AI

== Authentication ==
User -> Frontend: Login(email, password)
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/login
Backend -> MongoDB: find user by email
MongoDB --> Backend: user record
Backend --> Frontend: JWT + user profile
Frontend --> User: Dashboard shown

== AI Quiz Generation ==
User -> Frontend: Enter text / Upload PDF\nClick Generate Quiz
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/ai/generate-quiz (multipart)
Backend -> Backend: Extract text from file/content
Backend -> AI: Generate MCQ quiz(JSON prompt)
AI --> Backend: Quiz questions JSON
Backend --> Frontend: Quiz questions
Frontend --> User: Display quiz

== Submission & Summary ==
User -> Frontend: Submit answers
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/ai/quiz-summary
Backend -> Backend: Compute topic stats
Backend -> AI: Generate summary/recommendations
AI --> Backend: Summary JSON
Backend --> Frontend: Result + explanations + summary
Frontend --> User: Show result screen

== Persistence ==
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/quiz-attempts
Backend -> MongoDB: save attempt document
MongoDB --> Backend: saved
Backend --> Frontend: attempt saved

== History View ==
User -> Frontend: Open Quiz History
Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/quiz-history?userId=...
Backend -> MongoDB: fetch attempts by user
MongoDB --> Backend: attempts list
Backend --> Frontend: history + average score
Frontend --> User: Display history
@enduml
